          "change": "Show the cost and the billing start date in the invite dialog, above the button. The words are for the billing owner to confirm: '{{ price }} per month, from {{ start }}'.",
          "constraint": {
            "label": "Needs billing owner",
            "text": "Nothing is said about price until the billing owner confirms the figure and the start date. It is also not known whether billing really starts today in a trial."
